      "hero_eyebrow": "Our story",
      "hero_heading_default": "I got tired of starting every morning the same way.",
      "hero_sub_default": "Snooze. Scroll. Rush. Repeat.",
      "origin_eyebrow": "Our story",
      "origin_founder_name": "Mitchell White",
      "origin_founder_role": "Founder",
      "letter_lede": "I built MOOV because I was tired of waking up <em>already losing</em>.",
      "letter_p1": "The first conscious minute of the day used to belong to me. Then it belonged to whatever notification surfaced overnight \u2014 a work email, an algorithm\u2019s guess at what I should feel, a stranger\u2019s grievance. The phone next to the bed turned the morning into a feed before my feet ever touched the floor.",
      "letter_p2": "I tried the usual answers. A different alarm app. Phone in the kitchen. Old-school clock radios. The phone always came back, because the alarm came with it. The only thing that worked \u2014 for a week, then a month, then a year \u2014 was forcing the dismissal to happen <em>somewhere else.</em> Across the room. Past the door. In another tile of the house entirely.",
      "letter_p3": "MOOV is the version of that hack I wished someone else had built. A single object on a wall. One job. No screen, no notifications, no scroll. You walk, you press, you stay standing. The phone waits for you in the kitchen, where it belongs.",
      "letter_p4": "I think a lot about what isn\u2019t on MOOV. There are no streaks to keep up. No score for waking on time. No social feed of other people\u2019s mornings. Just a glowing ring across the room, and the small, ordinary triumph of crossing to meet it.",
      "letter_sign_off": "\u2014 Mitchell",
      "video_eyebrow_default": "Watch \u00b7 0:30",
      "video_heading_default": "I started building MOOV \u2014 a system designed to create movement first.",
      "video_sub_default": "Not motivation. Not guilt. Just action.",
      "video_film_chip": "Founder film",
      "video_film_title": "Founder film",
      "video_film_by": "With Mitchell White",
      "video_play_label": "Play the film",
      "manifesto_eyebrow": "What we believe",
      "manifesto_heading": "Why MOOV?",
      "manifesto_sub": "The idea behind MOOV was never just waking up. It was about creating momentum from the very start of the day.",
      "principle_1_title": "Momentum",
      "principle_1_body": "Progress you feel in your body before you feel it in your calendar.",
      "principle_2_title": "Output",
      "principle_2_body": "Finishing small, honest wins that stack.",
      "principle_3_title": "Optimism",
      "principle_3_body": "Mornings as a reset, not a verdict.",
      "principle_4_title": "Vitality",
      "principle_4_body": "Energy that comes from alignment, not adrenaline alone.",
      "pull_quote_text": "The best mornings are the ones you don\u2019t remember winning. You just notice, somewhere around lunch, that you never picked up your phone in bed.",
      "craft_eyebrow": "How it\u2019s made",
      "craft_heading_default": "Built for the wall it lives on.",
